.SH BUGS
One output, one framebuffer; no cursor plane, no hotplug yet.
.br
Command buffers are limited to the context's segment (1 MB).
.br
The host visible bar is mapped uncached.
.br
No sync files (a fence as a file of its own); on
.I virtiogpu
no sharing of fences between processes yet.
.IR I915 :
no sharing of objects between processes yet.
.br
.IR Amdgpu :
no display yet (outputs, scanout); a freed VRAM object stays visible
through BAR 0.
.br
Presenting copies every frame twice (device to host memory, host to
draw(3)); the kernel's console draws over the screen without rio.
